  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to the Energy Community Ukraine Energy Support Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This fund is designed to fund repairs to Ukraine&apos;s electricity grid, particularly in the wake of Russian attacks on Ukrainian critical national infrastructure in Winter 2022-23. The fund is administered by the Energy Community Secretariat.</narrative>
